@ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5245

GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

# Os endpoints do checkpoint estão definidos em docs/REQUISITOS.md.
# I04 — exige um token de usuário com a role Employee (variável @employeeToken, vinda do login).

@employeeToken = {{$processEnv EXPENSEHUB_EMPLOYEE_TOKEN}}

### Cria um rascunho
# @name createExpense
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço com cliente no centro",
  "amount": 87.50,
  "expenseDate": "2026-10-14",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Edita o rascunho criado acima
@expenseId = {{createExpense.response.body.$.id}}

PUT {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço com cliente no centro (corrigido)",
  "amount": 92.00,
  "expenseDate": "2026-10-14",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Consulta o reembolso
GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
